pattern: todowrite
count: 15
truncated: "false"
matches: "AGENT_FLOW.md:18:8. `<todos>` - call `todowrite` with the full list when a multi-step task starts, finishes, or drops a step. No ids. Omitted when the agent has no `todowrite` tool.\nexample/system-prompt.md:69:Call `todowrite` with the full list. Each item is content, status, and priority (high, medium, or low). Do not invent ids.\nexample/tool-stats/todowrite/README.md:1:# todowrite\nexample/tool-stats/todowrite/README.md:49:- `todowrite takes {\"todos\":[...]}`: missing `todos`, or `id` / `add` / `update` / `remove` / `clear` was sent.\nexample/tool-stats/todowrite/README.md:50:- `todowrite: todos[N] must be an object...`: an item is not an object.\nexample/tool-stats/todowrite/README.md:51:- `todowrite: todos[N] includes id...`: an item still has an id.\nexample/tool-stats/todowrite/README.md:52:- `todowrite: todos[N] is missing content/status/priority.`: a required field is absent.\nexample/tool-stats/todowrite/README.md:53:- `todowrite: todos[N].content is empty.` / `... exceeds 200 chars.`: blank or too long.\nexample/tool-stats/todowrite/README.md:54:- `todowrite: todos[N].status must be pending, in_progress, completed, or cancelled. Got \"...\".`: bad status.\nexample/tool-stats/todowrite/README.md:55:- `todowrite: todos[N].priority must be \"high\", \"medium\", or \"low\". Got \"...\".`: bad priority, including a number.\nexample/tool-stats/todowrite/README.md:56:- `todowrite: only one item can be in_progress.`: more than one active item. Names them.\nexample/tool-stats/todowrite/README.md:57:- `todowrite accepts at most 64 items, got N.`: list too long.\nexample/tool-stats/todowrite/README.md:58:- `todowrite needs the desktop shell.`: `ToolContext.app` is `None`.\nexample/tool-stats/todowrite/README.md:59:- `todowrite needs an active session id.`: tool ran without a session id.\nexample/tool-stats/todowrite/stats.md:1:# todowrite"